WEBVTT

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:34.360
And I say in return, "No, thank you."

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:38.240
To the world and to my mother.

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:40.896
Well, to tell you the truth,

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:43.296
all I said was, "OK, Mom,
I'll talk to you later."

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:44.616
(Laughter)

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:47.976
But in my mind, I said, "No, thank you."

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:51.400
I cannot accept her bargain either.

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:53.480
Nor should you.

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:58.816
It would be easy
for many of us in rooms like this

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:01.736
to see ourselves as safe,